  "title": "Becky&#39;s Gluten-Free Slow Cooker Chicken Vegetable Soup",
  "description": "This gluten-free chicken and vegetable soup is easy to make in your slow cooker. With juicy chicken and lots of veggies, it&#39;s sure to please the family!",
